{"actor_id":"par_t1_maker","content_hash":"sha256:7bd4ee18fd4141088430d16774e49b35c0a3547e81b54d9398044a2ea71e4b8b","event_id":"evt_decisionrequestopened_mrh3w4hi_e0162066","event_type":"DecisionRequestOpened","hash_version":"clista.event_hash.v1","payload":{"decisionRequest":{"id":"drq_t1_mrh3w4hh_53745a88","object":"decisionRequest","objectionIds":[],"openedAt":"2026-07-12T01:19:55.829Z","openedByParticipantId":"par_t1_maker","proposal":"The toy service should pin its dependency versions to exact releases in a lockfile committed to the repository.","status":"review","supportingAssumptionIds":["asm_t1_mrh3w4hg_830b148f"],"supportingClaimIds":["clm_t1_mrh3w4hh_b82901b1"],"supportingEvidenceIds":["evd_t1_mrh3w4hf_a71d3097"],"threadId":"thd_sealed_run_mrh3w4h9_d5d01472"}},"previous_hash":"sha256:0727c1b0d98646986d5591c8ecf5db0fb992fa2c07a4d0384d6cd6ac163f3f24","protocol_version":"clista.protocol.v0","thread_id":"thd_sealed_run_mrh3w4h9_d5d01472","timestamp":"2026-07-12T01:19:55.830Z"}
{"actor_id":"par_t1_checker","content_hash":"sha256:5acb50efc9045ce8c96fb096a2e1f9a59a30e0a3b7b87c428e595e5de9a1fa40","event_id":"evt_objectionraised_mrh3w4hi_18bf42c4","event_type":"ObjectionRaised","hash_version":"clista.event_hash.v1","payload":{"objection":{"blocking":false,"id":"obj_t1_mrh3w4hi_b50b3b41","object":"objection","participantId":"par_t1_checker","raisedAt":"2026-07-12T01:19:55.830Z","statement":"The proposal's safety rests entirely on an unenforced assumption — a scheduled update process that doesn't exist yet — so committing an exact-pin lockfile today trades a hypothetical overnight breakage (already survivable via CI catching it) for a concrete failure mode where known CVEs sit unpatched indefinitely because nothing in the proposal makes the update cadence actually happen.","status":"open","targetObjectId":"drq_t1_mrh3w4hh_53745a88","targetObjectType":"decisionRequest","threadId":"thd_sealed_run_mrh3w4h9_d5d01472"}},"previous_hash":"sha256:7bd4ee18fd4141088430d16774e49b35c0a3547e81b54d9398044a2ea71e4b8b","protocol_version":"clista.protocol.v0","thread_id":"thd_sealed_run_mrh3w4h9_d5d01472","timestamp":"2026-07-12T01:19:55.830Z"}
{"actor_id":"par_t1_checker","content_hash":"sha256:24a00f59d5a02ca03aa9b4d8864a4ef8e5bfdfa22ff670eb2c6b42fa14b37fd0","event_id":"evt_objectionresolved_mrh3w4hj_a9ce09c5","event_type":"ObjectionResolved","hash_version":"clista.event_hash.v1","payload":{"objectionId":"obj_t1_mrh3w4hi_b50b3b41","resolution":"The objection is addressed because the update cadence is no longer an unenforced assumption — the same commit that pins the lockfile ships a Renovate/Dependabot weekly-PR config and a CI job that fails builds on known CVEs, making stale pins a merge-blocking condition rather than a silent risk."},"previous_hash":"sha256:5acb50efc9045ce8c96fb096a2e1f9a59a30e0a3b7b87c428e595e5de9a1fa40","protocol_version":"clista.protocol.v0","thread_id":"thd_sealed_run_mrh3w4h9_d5d01472","timestamp":"2026-07-12T01:19:55.831Z"}
{"actor_id":"par_t1_checker","content_hash":"sha256:a6f287617bd5288f2177dcb8c0ae46b416eb29d7ca3316e127461f440c2df364","event_id":"evt_reviewsubmitted_mrh3w4hk_9547be2b","event_type":"ReviewSubmitted","hash_version":"clista.event_hash.v1","payload":{"review":{"conditions":[],"decisionRequestId":"drq_t1_mrh3w4hh_53745a88","id":"rev_t1_mrh3w4hk_4eeede99","notes":"Approve contingent on the enforcement pieces (bot config + audit CI gate) actually landing in that commit, since the safety argument now depends on them shipping together.","object":"review","reviewedAt":"2026-07-12T01:19:55.832Z","reviewerParticipantId":"par_t1_checker","status":"approve","threadId":"thd_sealed_run_mrh3w4h9_d5d01472"}},"previous_hash":"sha256:24a00f59d5a02ca03aa9b4d8864a4ef8e5bfdfa22ff670eb2c6b42fa14b37fd0","protocol_version":"clista.protocol.v0","thread_id":"thd_sealed_run_mrh3w4h9_d5d01472","timestamp":"2026-07-12T01:19:55.832Z"}
{"actor_id":"par_t1_maker","content_hash":"sha256:514327b4d6ee91d667f8de10c3b4b027b707a8188cf1c21782444794c02b0a23","event_id":"evt_decisionmerged_mrh3w4hl_eef891df","event_type":"DecisionMerged","hash_version":"clista.event_hash.v1","payload":{"decisionRecord":{"decidedAt":"2026-07-12T01:19:55.833Z","decidedByParticipantId":"par_t1_maker","decisionRequestId":"drq_t1_mrh3w4hh_53745a88","id":"dcr_t1_mrh3w4hl_542c65ac","object":"decisionRecord","rationale":"The checker is right that pinning without an enforced cadence converts reproducibility into indefinite CVE exposure, so the decision makes the cadence tooling-enforced and co-committed rather than assumed.","reviewIds":["rev_t1_mrh3w4hk_4eeede99"],"status":"approved","summary":"Adopt the exact-pin committed lockfile, but only landed together with automated update PRs and a CVE-audit CI gate in the same change.","supportingAssumptionIds":["asm_t1_mrh3w4hg_830b148f"],"supportingClaimIds":["clm_t1_mrh3w4hh_b82901b1"],"supportingEvidenceIds":["evd_t1_mrh3w4hf_a71d3097"],"threadId":"thd_sealed_run_mrh3w4h9_d5d01472"}},"previous_hash":"sha256:a6f287617bd5288f2177dcb8c0ae46b416eb29d7ca3316e127461f440c2df364","protocol_version":"clista.protocol.v0","thread_id":"thd_sealed_run_mrh3w4h9_d5d01472","timestamp":"2026-07-12T01:19:55.833Z"}
